  "description": "<p>As the <a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/_/openjdk\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">openjdk image</a> has been deprecated, the <a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/_/tomcat\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">tomcat image</a> has switched to Eclipse Temurin by default now.</p>\n\n<p>The following image should be used from now on: <tt>tomcat:9-jdk11</tt><a href=\"https://github.com/docker-library/tomcat/blob/4ef8521605121c14062319c9b8688fa4de044ba0/9.0/jdk11/temurin-noble/Dockerfile\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">⁠</a> (or <tt>tomcat:9-jdk11-temurin</tt> if it should be explicit that Eclipse Temurin is used as JDK).⁠</p>\n\n<p>It should also be considered to switch to <tt>tomcat:9-jre11</tt><a href=\"https://github.com/docker-library/tomcat/blob/4ef8521605121c14062319c9b8688fa4de044ba0/9.0/jre11/temurin-noble/Dockerfile\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">⁠</a> (or <tt>tomcat:9-jre11-temurin</tt>) to for the final Image as a JDK should not be necessary to run it.</p>",
